    "detailed_description": "This game is about cleaner Klof. He was trapped inside a huge supercomputer dungeon, which is filled with bugs and dust. Use your mop and upgrade it to find way out!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Run, jump, grab, fall - fast paced platformer<br></li><li> Follow the lighting which<br></li><li> Each level is two-phased with different game modes. First phase is about exploration and preparation. Second phase is ESCAPE THIS PLACE.<br></li><li> Linear game with non-linear level's completion. There are few biomes with 16 levels each.<br></li><li> Upgrade your mop and gain new abilities to reach new places or improve levels results.</li></ul><br>Using a mop is an important process. You'll have to clean dirt to move faster on surfaces, as well as clean lamps so they give more light. You can grab to the net with a mop, reaching great heights. And also turn the bugs over with a mop and jump on them. And more awesome features using only mop!",
